    "blob_url": "https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2FREADME.md",
    "raw_url": "https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/raw/fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2FREADME.md",
    "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NeoTech/Camcraft/contents/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2FREADME.md?ref=fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617",
    "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# Plate edge work\n+\n+This original 60 x 40 x 6 mm plate compares four closed edge operations.\n+The stock is the finished plate. This case does not rough a blank.\n+\n+| Operation | Tool | Inspect |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Chamfer | 6 mm, 90 degree cone | A 0.8 mm wide chamfer on the top outline. |\n+| Deburr | Same cone | A 0.3 mm edge break. The tip window excludes the bottom edges. |\n+| Engrave | 6 mm end mill | A shallow closed perimeter mark at Z 5.8. |\n+| Trace | Same end mill | The same closed path and depth as the engraved mark. |\n+\n+Engrave and Trace intentionally share the plate boundary. Compare their\n+posted paths. They show closed perimeter marking, not text or open curves.\n+Chamfer and Deburr also compare two edge treatments on the same model.\n+These repeated cuts form a debugging example, not a production sequence.\n+Deburr reports skipped vertical corner edges that the vertical cone cannot\n+reach. This informational note leaves the top outline cut complete.\n+\n+Inspect the four operation sections in `edge-work.nc`. Each must contain\n+cutting moves. Check the cone offsets and the shallow marking depth.\n+The project embeds its original mesh and has no external model link.\n+\n+Regenerate the model with `python3 model/gen_edge_work_obj.py`.\n+From the repository root, rebuild with\n+`cargo xtask catalog --case 2d/edge-work`.\n+Run `cargo xtask catalog --check` and\n+`cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog` to check reproducibility."
  },
  {
    "sha": "ec6cea7aa8b3a161edb7cef4ef82104588d16d28",
    "filename": "examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/build.camscript",
    "status": "added",
    "additions": 36,
    "deletions": 0,
    "changes": 36,
    "blob_url": "https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2Fbuild.camscript",
    "raw_url": "https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/raw/fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2Fbuild.camscript",
    "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NeoTech/Camcraft/contents/examples%2Fcatalog%2F2d%2Fedge-work%2Fbuild.camscript?ref=fddf5300f0e8b2eb481eeece6c7d850a366c3617",
    "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\n+// Provenance: original plate edge-work example using CamCraft commands.\n+cam.import(\"model/edge-work.obj\", \"edge-work\");\n+cam.call(\"set_model_link\", { model: \"edge-work\", path: null });\n+cam.call(\"set_stock\", { from_model: \"edge-work\" });\n+cam.call(\"add_tool\", { catalog: \"CM-0600-90\", holder: \"none\" });\n+cam.call(\"add_tool\", { catalog: \"EM-0600-4FL\", holder: \"none\" });\n+\n+cam.call(\"add_operation\", {\n+  kind: \"2D Chamfer\", name: \"Chamfer\", tool: \"CM-0600-90\", source: \"edge-work\",\n+  params: { width: 0.8, angle_deg: 45.0, clearance_z: 21.0,\n+    top_z: 6.0, feed: 800.0, plunge_feed: 200.0, climb: true, side: \"auto\" }\n+});\n+cam.call(\"add_operation\", {\n+  kind: \"Deburr\", name: \"Deburr\", tool: \"CM-0600-90\", source: \"edge-work\",\n+  // The window bounds the tip, 0.3 mm below the top edge for a 90 degree cone.\n+  params: { width: 0.3, clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.0,\n+    feed: 800.0, plunge_feed: 200.0 }\n+});\n+cam.call(\"add_operation\", {\n+  kind: \"Engrave\", name: \"Engrave\", tool: \"EM-0600-4FL\", source: \"edge-work\",\n+  params: { clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.8,\n+    stepdown: 1.0, feed: 600.0, plunge_feed: 150.0, climb: true }\n+});\n+cam.call(\"add_operation\", {\n+  kind: \"Trace\", name: \"Trace\", tool: \"EM-0600-4FL\", source: \"edge-work\",\n+  params: { clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.8,\n+    stepdown: 1.0, feed: 600.0, plunge_feed: 150.0, climb: true }\n+});\n+cam.generate();\n+var verdict = cam.verify();\n+if (!verdict.ok) {\n+  throw new Error(\"catalog verify failed: \" + JSON.stringify(verdict));\n+}\n+cam.save(\"edge-work.camproj\");\n+cam.post({ to: \"edge-work.nc\" });\n+cam.report();"
  },
